    "doc": {
      "text_zh": "主题：第 VIII 层结晶流磨损异常（第 ██ 次跟进）\n发文部门：铸字计量室 → 第 VIII 层收容督查\n表单编号：F-017-████ / 第 ██ 次提交\n\n本次跟进与前 ██ 次记录相同，无需另行说明。\n\n铭刻完成后，键徒所呈递之结晶流部分无法入账。标准结晶流称量未见异常，但总录数始终低于应得数。分配至该区段的 D 级人员均报告铭刻",
      "text_en": "SUBJECT: Layer VIII Crystalline Humour Attrition Anomaly (Follow-up No. ██)\nISSUING DEPT: Bureau of Litanic Measures → Layer VIII Containment Supervision\nFORM: F-017-████ / Submission No. ██\n\nThis follow-up is identical to the preceding ██ submissions. No further elaboration is required.\n\nFollowing completion of inscription, a portion of the Crystalline Humour tendered by Clavigerants cannot be entered into the ledger. Standard Crystalline Humour assay returns no anomaly. Total registered yield consistently falls below the entitled figure. D-class personnel assigned to this sector uniformly report that inscription feels complete — the keys descended, the press pulled, the word sealed. They do not report error. The shortfall is not reflected in any instrument.\n\nThe Bureau of Litanic Measures has recalibrated Layer VIII assay apparatus on ██ separate occasions. Results remain within acceptable tolerance on each occasion.\n\nD-████ submitted a supplementary note with the ██th report: \"Something takes a share before I can hand it over. It has been doing so since before I arrived.\"\n\nNote has been archived under F-044 (completed by supervising personnel, per protocol).\n\nAudit status: Pending.\nNo corrective action has been assigned."
    }
