      "text_en": "Anomaly No.: RA-██ · Decoy Interference\nGradus Formae: Mobilum\nFiling Dept.: Layer ██ Containment Affairs Office\n\n**Internal Memorandum**\nSubject: Layer ██ Lectern Interference Phenomenon (Follow-up No. ██)\n\nAs reported by Layer ██ keybound personnel, during active inscription, leaden glyphs of intact form have been observed seating themselves into lectern positions without directive — bearing no correspondence to any version of the containment litany issued that day. Keybound personnel proceeded with inscription as standard. Subsequently, verified impressions already recorded within the key-bed exhibited disturbance; a portion of previously completed inscription records reverted to null. First documented M.2██, Month ██. Initial assessment: compositor error. F-017 filed accordingly.\n\nThis memorandum constitutes follow-up No. ██.\n\nAddendum: D-████ submitted a written declaration regarding the above, stating that"
